  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electrification and Development of Electrical Connection Project - PEDECEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Objectives: 

The Bank&#x2019;s intervention in the PEDECEL Program (designated as the IsDB Project or the Project) will help Burkina Faso towards achieving SDG 7-Affordable and Clean Energy (Ensure access to affordable, reliable, sustainable and modern energy for all), SDG 8-Decent Work and Economic Growth (Promote sustained, inclusive and sustainable economic growth, full and productive employment and decent work for all), SDG 9-Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure (Build resilient infrastructure, promote inclusive and sustainable industrialization and foster innovation), and SDG 11-Sustainable Cities and Communities (Make cities inclusive, safe, resilient and sustainable).

The Project is addressing the current need within Burkina Faso for the Electrification and Development of Electrical Connection and the direct beneficiaries are the populations and businesses residing in the Project areas.

The Project&#x2019;s goal is to support the socio-economic growth and development of Burkina Faso through the achievement of universal access to electricity service in and more specifically in the targeted Project&#x2019;s areas, in order to improve the living conditions of the population. 

